``refids`` and ``REQUEST-STATUS`` now return ``None`` instead of an
empty list when the component has no such values, and setting either
to ``None`` or an empty list now deletes the property. Modifying the
list returned by these properties no longer has any effect on the
component; previously this worked inconsistently, only mutating the
component when two or more values were already set. Part of #1722. I
used AI to assist me with this change. @nihirborkar17
